    "content": "<p>As Season 1: Blockade comes to an end on June 16, we want to say thank you to all of our Pilots for playing War Robots: Frontiers this Season&mdash;we are so grateful for all your feedback, playtime, and support. We hope you&rsquo;re looking forward to the electrifying <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/210\"><strong>Season 2: Power Surge</strong></a>!&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p>Season 1: Blockade saw millions of War Robots built for battle, dominating the battlefield, and destroyed, with your favorite Pilots, Modules, and Weapons revealed along the way. Amidst all this excitement, War Robots: Frontiers hit a major milestone&mdash;<strong>one million players!&nbsp;</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/06/224-Infographic/1.jpg\" /></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Check out the rest of your achievements and the highlights of Season 1 below.&nbsp;</p>\r\n\r\n<p><strong><preview-image src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/06/224-Infographic/Season_1_stats_full.jpg\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static-eu.prod-my.games/chronos-public-eu-wrf-prod/site/2025/06/224-Infographic/Season_1_stats_full.jpg\" width=\"1080\" /></preview-image></strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Don&rsquo;t forget, the <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/news/217\"><strong>Smuggler&#39;s Run Battle Pass</strong></a> ends on<strong> June 16!</strong> Grab it before it&rsquo;s too late, and sting the enemy with new War Robot Scorpion, Tusk Weapons, and tons of in-game currency and cosmetic items.</p>\r\n\r\n<hr />\r\n<p><strong>Download War Robots: Frontiers for free today and prepare for the electrifying Season 2: Power Surge on June 17:</strong></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;5</strong></a><strong>│</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/playstation\"><strong>PlayStation&reg;4</strong></a><strong>│ </strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox Series X|S</strong></a><strong> │</strong><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/xbox\"><strong>Xbox One</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/steam\"><strong>Steam</strong></a><strong> │ </strong><a href=\"https://my.games/play/war_robots_frontiers_mg\"><strong>MY.GAMES Launcher</strong></a></p>\r\n\r\n<p>Stay tuned to our official <a href=\"https://x.com/WRFrontiers\">X</a>, <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/wrfrontiers\">Facebook</a>, <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/wrfrontiers/\">Instagram</a>, <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UC7xxqQkPAQ7x6wIVEPZus5w\">YouTube</a>, and <a href=\"https://www.tiktok.com/@wrfrontiers\">TikTok</a> channels, and join the <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/warrobotsfrontiers/\">War Robots: Frontiers subreddit</a> and <a href=\"https://warrobotsfrontiers.com/l/discord\">Discord</a> for all the latest news and updates!</p>",
